# Self-hosting

Clone the repository and install dependencies in the environment that will build the web application:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Uncoil-dev/Uncoil
cd Uncoil
npm ci
npm run build
```

Configure the public Convex endpoint, authentication settings, Tinybird host and token, and provider keys in server-side environment variables. Use separate Convex and Tinybird environments for staging and production, and verify authentication before exposing dashboard routes.
